        "Zeitlind",
        "Lind",
        "my sister",
        "younger sister"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [],
      "comment": "Raumhilda: Zeitlind",
      "content": "Raumhilda's younger sister, introverted and reserved, with the same face. Raumhilda read to her before she could read herself, and they imagined exploring Teyvat together. After Raumhilda vanished, Zeitlind went to the sanatorium to say goodbye and, with the Traveler, followed her sister's trail through the Temple of Space.\n\nIn The Final Judgment, Zeitlind gives up her own memories to follow her sister's path, defeats Melanta with the Traveler, and afterwards composes her epitaph, \"To be continued\". Istoria asks Zeitlind to give Hilda his regards.",
