    "1": {
      "uid": 1,
      "key": [
        "Temple of Space",
        "Atrium of Suchness",
        "Path to the Heavens",
        "stagnant space-time"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [
        "Raumhilda",
        "Hilda"
      ],
      "comment": "Raumhilda: The Temple of Space",
      "content": "A realm reached from the sanatorium on Windrest Peak, divided into exhibition spaces such as Luyang Academy, the Mahavaipulya Chamber and the Desert Pavilion. Its inhabitants live in stagnant space-time. Its keeper Istoria says time stands still there. Melanta, a being made by the absent Asmoday, tyrannises it.\n\nThe Path to the Heavens reaches the Atrium of Suchness only if someone gives up all their memories. Raumhilda did this, and Zeitlind later does the same.",
