        "Melanta"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [
        "Raumhilda",
        "Hilda"
      ],
      "comment": "Raumhilda: Melanta",
      "content": "The temple's punisher. Raumhilda met him in the Atrium of Suchness. They could not reach an agreement; she predicted her younger sister would defeat him, and in his rage he broke part of the Path to the Heavens made from her memories.",
