        "Kamera"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [
        "Raumhilda",
        "Hilda"
      ],
      "comment": "Raumhilda: Painting, drawing and the Kamera",
      "content": "At Luyang Academy, Daozi and Bosch taught Raumhilda to draw; she produced a watermelon still life named \"Long Live Life\". Bosch found no childlike innocence in it, only sadness. She also told the painters about Kameras, devices that make lifelike pictures. Photographs from her vacation show her in front of Wangshu Inn in Liyue.",
