      "comment": "Raumhilda: The grave",
      "content": "At the old sanatorium on Windrest Peak stands a tombstone for Raumhilda, but the grave is empty. Its epitaph reads \"One lifetime doesn't count\". She told Vitruvius about it in the Desert Pavilion.",
